  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine sour cream, mayonnaise, apple cider vinegar, mustard, and sugar in a bowl; stir until evenly mixed. Fold in blue cheese crumbles; mix in cabbage and carrot mix and grapes. Season with salt and pepper. Top with chopped bacon.",
